# syntax=ghcr.io/railwayapp/railpack-frontend:v0.0.32
# Joint control image (runner binary + UI) built from railpack.json at the
# repo root via plain buildx — push, cache, and multi-arch all work as usual:
#   docker buildx build -f docker/Dockerfile.railpack -t <tag> --push .
# The frontend has its own versioning (NOT the railpack CLI version) —
# re-pin when upgrading. Local dev keeps the explicit Dockerfiles
# (compose.yaml) — this file is Coolify/CI only.
